flowchart TB
  facts[Four adopted source facts] --> choose{Entry complete?}
  choose -- no product CLI fact --> normal[Ordinary argv and v9 validator / observation closed]
  choose -- all facts --> entry[Opt-in argv and projector and validator together]
  scope[Fixed historical Rabbit scope / no current permission default] --> permit[Owned local permit / readback and supply bindings]
  permit --> begin{Host UID platform window valid?}
  begin -- yes --> claim[Exclusive durable capture claim]
  claim --> scan[One native scan / same-report context]
  entry --> scan
  scan --> original[Exact captured bytes / revision time package binding]
  original --> queue[Separate report and ACK outputs / enqueue]
  queue --> sendclaim{Durable send claim and active window?}
  sendclaim -- yes --> post[One POST / redirect error / no fragments]
  sendclaim -- no --> held[Hardlink held outbox / fsync before queue unlink]
  post --> result[One send result record / receipt distinct from ACK]
  result -- accepted and ACK succeeded --> deleted[Queue deletion / captured original retained]
  result -- HTTP network timeout or ACK unknown --> held
  claim -. failure does not restore budget .-> retained[Claims and originals retained]
  original --> retained
  normal --> ordinary[Existing ordinary retry and fragment contracts]
  context[Seven fixed safe-context fields] --> validation[Validate extension then full existing v9 rules]
  validation --> view[Same-report projection only / UI delivery not implemented here]
